## Out of scope

- Ask page, composer, citation links, and where the thread lives in the UI (T0220).
- A stored conversation table.
- Tool use, writes, or a second retrieval pass over the history.
- Changing context assembly, search, or the prompt registry schema.

## Acceptance

- A question whose packet contains the supporting record returns that record’s display number, and a PDF chunk’s page when the model cites it.
- A citation whose ref or page was not in the included packet does not appear in `citations`.
- An excluded project, or a project whose packet has no citable item, returns the fixed “nothing to answer from” sentence and does not call the model.
- A follow-up that includes prior turns still searches on the new question only.
